From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:14:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] setupapi: custom directory ids belong to the INF they were
 set for

SetupSetDirectoryId with an INF handle sets the id for that INF (and its appended
files) only; with NULL or INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE it sets it for all. Closing the INF
drops its ids, id 0 clears an INF's ids. A custom id in a DestinationDirs line that
nobody set stands for the INF's own directory. Removes 3 todo_wine in advpack's
TranslateInfString tests.

diff --git a/dlls/advpack/tests/advpack.c b/dlls/advpack/tests/advpack.c
index f704f66..3075f0f 100644
